    "void": "No particle emitted, no trajectory defined, no cascade initiated, no detector trigger — the universe before this cosmic ray existed",
    "true": "Hadronic cascade confirmed: muon bundle detected, nuclear interactions reconstructed, primary energy deposited in hadronic channel",
    "false": "Electromagnetic cascade confirmed: electron/photon cascade detected, radiation-length scaling observed, primary energy deposited in EM channel",
    "both": "Composition paradox held live: shower fluctuations and muon excess simultaneously support proton and iron primaries — the GZK-violating energy makes both hypotheses constructively true and false at once"
  },
